      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Tufo de Algodão. Travesseiros e camas recheados com o algodão expelido por Cottonee são macios, leves e de excelente qualidade. Quando atacado, ele libera algodão como isca para distrair o inimigo e escapar.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Fada, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Cottonee pode evoluir para Whimsicott no nível 6 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Sun Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Absorb, Fairy Wind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Stun Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Cotton Spore</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Razor Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Poison Powder</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Charm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Helping Hand</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Energy Ball</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Cotton Guard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Sunny Day</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Endeavor, Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Beat Up, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dazzling Gleam, Defog, Double Team, Dream Eater, Encore, Endeavor, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Knock Off, Misty Terrain, Nature Power, Protect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Taunt, Tera Blast, Toxic, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Beat Up, Captivate, Encore, Fake Tears, Grass Whistle, Memento, Misty Terrain, Natural Gift, Nature Power, Switcheroo, Tickle, Worry Seed</p>",
